WEBVTT

00:00:09,010 --> 00:00:15,490
I have stage 4 prostate cancer. What would you recommend? Well, that's kind of a

00:00:15,490 --> 00:00:20,690
loaded question because I don't have like a protocol for or stage 4 prostate

00:00:20,690 --> 00:00:25,490
cancer. So we do cheek swab testing for our cancer patients and then we make

00:00:25,490 --> 00:00:30,970
recommendations based on that. And you could have two twin brothers with

00:00:30,970 --> 00:00:33,850
prostate cancer and their recommendations could be completely different because

00:00:33,850 --> 00:00:40,290
everybody's unique. But in general, what should a person do with a prostate

00:00:40,290 --> 00:00:44,050
cancer? Well, you should do some things that decrease inflammation. But

00:00:44,050 --> 00:00:47,770
it partly depends on what else you're doing from a standard of care perspective.

00:00:47,770 --> 00:00:52,890
If you're doing loop run or an energy deprivation therapy, everybody do an

00:00:52,890 --> 00:00:57,650
energy deprivation therapy, which is if you're going to follow standards of

00:00:57,650 --> 00:01:00,690
care with prostate cancer, it's just what everybody's going to be in that kind of

00:01:00,690 --> 00:01:09,290
memory. You should be doing andrographis. Andrographis is an herb, and everybody

00:01:09,290 --> 00:01:15,090
doing energy deprivation therapy should be own. Also, EGCG, which is the

00:01:15,090 --> 00:01:21,730
Catechin from Green T extract. Everybody that's doing energy deprivation therapy

00:01:21,730 --> 00:01:27,210
should be on that. Now historically, loop run, energy deprivation therapy, will

00:01:27,210 --> 00:01:34,250
reduce a person's PSA. So if you have PSA, if 31, or 12, or 700, it will

00:01:34,250 --> 00:01:38,690
typically bring that PSA down. It will give you some comfort that may have my PSA

00:01:38,690 --> 00:01:42,970
dropped in half after I started loop run. But there's question to whether it

00:01:42,970 --> 00:01:55,050
actually decreases the growth of the cancer product. So if you're

00:01:55,170 --> 00:02:00,290
have to be on loop run, you want it to work as long as possible. The other issue

00:02:00,290 --> 00:02:06,250
with loop run has been that it tends to work for a period of time, maybe a year,

00:02:06,250 --> 00:02:11,090
maybe two years, maybe four years, and then it just doesn't seem to work. Well,

00:02:11,090 --> 00:02:17,570
studies have shown that andrographis and Green T extract, EGCG, increase the

00:02:17,570 --> 00:02:22,450
time that that that drug will work. If you're going to be on it, you want it to

00:02:22,450 --> 00:02:27,170
work as long as possible. Even if you're going to go off and beat those two

00:02:27,170 --> 00:02:33,370
different nutritional products, can hold the benefits of that for a longer period

00:02:33,370 --> 00:02:41,770
of time, relatively inexpensive thing to do. If you go to cuttersclinic.com and

